{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 19,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 475.597,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord commanded me,",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.827,
      "end": 5.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore I did make plates of ore",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.422,
      "end": 8.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might engraven upon them the record of my people.",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.085,
      "end": 11.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And upon the plates which I made",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.773,
      "end": 14.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I did engraven the record of my father,",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.739,
      "end": 17.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also our journeyings in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.659,
      "end": 19.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the prophecies of my father;",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.882,
      "end": 23.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also many of mine own prophecies have I engraven upon them.",
      "verse": "19:1",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 24.277,
      "end": 26.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I knew not at the time when I made them",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.011,
      "end": 30.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should be commanded of the Lord to make these plates;",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.535,
      "end": 33.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, the record of my father,",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 33.223,
      "end": 35.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the genealogy of his fathers,",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 36.004,
      "end": 39.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the more part of all our proceedings in the wilderness",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 39.713,
      "end": 43.753,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are engraven upon those first plates of which I have spoken;",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 43.933,
      "end": 49.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, the things which transpired before I made these plates are, of a truth,",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 49.407,
      "end": 52.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "more particularly made mention upon the first plates.",
      "verse": "19:2",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 53.245,
      "end": 56.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after I had made these plates by way of commandment,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 56.954,
      "end": 59.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I, Nephi, received a commandment",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.363,
      "end": 61.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the ministry and the prophecies,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 61.865,
      "end": 64.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the more plain and precious parts of them,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 64.599,
      "end": 66.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should be written upon these plates;",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 67.008,
      "end": 69.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that the things which were written",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 69.51,
      "end": 72.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should be kept for the instruction of my people,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 72.43,
      "end": 74.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who should possess the land,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 74.653,
      "end": 77.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also for other wise purposes,",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 77.201,
      "end": 79.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which purposes are known unto the Lord.",
      "verse": "19:3",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 80.296,
      "end": 84.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I, Nephi, did make a record upon the other plates,",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 85.12,
      "end": 86.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which gives a account,",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 86.879,
      "end": 89.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or which gives a greater account of the wars",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 89.892,
      "end": 93.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and contentions and destructions of my people.",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 93.183,
      "end": 96.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this have I done, and commanded my people",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 96.242,
      "end": 98.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what they should do after I was gone;",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 98.744,
      "end": 103.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that these plates should be handed down from one generation to another,",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 103.986,
      "end": 108.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or from one prophet to another, until further commandments of the Lord.",
      "verse": "19:4",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 109.078,
      "end": 113.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And an account of my making these plates shall be given hereafter;",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 113.856,
      "end": 119.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then, behold, I proceed according to that which I have spoken; and this I do",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 119.562,
      "end": 124.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the more sacred things may be kept for the knowledge of my people.",
      "verse": "19:5",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 124.793,
      "end": 128.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, I do not write anything upon plates",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 128.41,
      "end": 130.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be that I think it be sacred.",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 131.005,
      "end": 134.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, if I do err, even did they err of old;",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 134.9,
      "end": 138.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not that I would excuse myself because of other men,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 138.935,
      "end": 143.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but because of the weakness which is in me, according to the flesh,",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 143.387,
      "end": 144.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would excuse myself.",
      "verse": "19:6",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 145.646,
      "end": 151.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the things which some men esteem to be of great worth, both to the body and soul,",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 151.77,
      "end": 154.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "others set at naught and trample under their feet.",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 155.108,
      "end": 157.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, even the very God of Israel",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 157.842,
      "end": 159.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do men trample under their feet;",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 160.065,
      "end": 162.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say, trample under their feet",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 162.474,
      "end": 165.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I would speak in other words\u2014 they set him at naught,",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 165.858,
      "end": 168.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hearken not to the voice of his counsels.",
      "verse": "19:7",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 169.324,
      "end": 175.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold he cometh, according to the words of the angel, in six hundred years from the time my father left Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "19:8",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 176.645,
      "end": 179.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the world, because of their iniquity,",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 179.379,
      "end": 181.84,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall judge him to be a thing of naught;",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 182.02,
      "end": 183.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore they scourge him,",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 184.011,
      "end": 185.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he suffereth it;",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 185.816,
      "end": 187.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they smite him,",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 187.343,
      "end": 188.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he suffereth it.",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 189.148,
      "end": 190.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they spit upon him,",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 190.907,
      "end": 193.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he suffereth it, because of his loving kindness",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 193.873,
      "end": 197.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his long-suffering towards the children of men.",
      "verse": "19:9",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 197.943,
      "end": 199.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the God of our fathers,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 200.12,
      "end": 202.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were led out of Egypt, out of bondage,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 203.133,
      "end": 206.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also were preserved in the wilderness by him,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 206.517,
      "end": 210.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the God of Abraham, and of Isaac, and the God of Jacob,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 210.877,
      "end": 213.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yieldeth himself, according to the words of the angel,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 214.122,
      "end": 223.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a man, into the hands of wicked men, to be lifted up, according to the words of Zenock, and to be crucified, according to the words of Neum,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 223.683,
      "end": 227.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to be buried in a sepulchre, according to the words of Zenos,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 227.671,
      "end": 230.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he spake concerning the three days of darkness,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 231.102,
      "end": 233.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which should be a sign given of his death",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 233.883,
      "end": 237.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto those who should inhabit the isles of the sea,",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 237.592,
      "end": 242.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "more especially given unto those who are of the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "19:10",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 242.73,
      "end": 244.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For thus spake the prophet:",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 244.907,
      "end": 248.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Lord God surely shall visit all the house of Israel at that day,",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 248.802,
      "end": 253.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "some with his voice, because of their righteousness, unto their great joy and salvation,",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 254.09,
      "end": 258.316,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and others with the thunderings and the lightnings of his power,",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 258.496,
      "end": 260.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by tempest, by fire,",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 260.487,
      "end": 262.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by smoke, and vapor of darkness,",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 263.175,
      "end": 265.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by the opening of the earth,",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 265.491,
      "end": 268.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by mountains which shall be carried up.",
      "verse": "19:11",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 268.818,
      "end": 272.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all these things must surely come, saith the prophet Zenos.",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 272.574,
      "end": 275.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the rocks of the earth must rend;",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 275.308,
      "end": 277.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because of the groanings of the earth,",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 278.135,
      "end": 281.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many of the kings of the isles of the sea",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 281.194,
      "end": 284.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be wrought upon by the Spirit of God, to exclaim:",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 284.857,
      "end": 286.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The God of nature suffers.",
      "verse": "19:12",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 287.302,
      "end": 290.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as for those who are at Jerusalem, saith the prophet,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 291.104,
      "end": 293.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be scourged by all people,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 293.745,
      "end": 296.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they crucify the God of Israel,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 296.619,
      "end": 298.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and turn their hearts aside,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 298.703,
      "end": 300.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "rejecting signs and wonders,",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 300.833,
      "end": 303.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the power and glory of the God of Israel.",
      "verse": "19:13",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 304.346,
      "end": 307.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because they turn their hearts aside, saith the prophet,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 307.591,
      "end": 310.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have despised the Holy One of Israel,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 310.465,
      "end": 313.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall wander in the flesh, and perish,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 313.246,
      "end": 315.429,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become a hiss and a byword,",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 315.609,
      "end": 317.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be hated among all nations.",
      "verse": "19:14",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 318.518,
      "end": 321.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, when that day cometh, saith the prophet,",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 321.856,
      "end": 326.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they no more turn aside their hearts against the Holy One of Israel,",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 326.68,
      "end": 330.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then will he remember the covenants which he made to their fathers.",
      "verse": "19:15",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 330.75,
      "end": 333.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, then will he remember the isles of the sea;",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 334.088,
      "end": 339.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and all the people who are of the house of Israel, will I gather in,",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 339.376,
      "end": 346.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord, according to the words of the prophet Zenos, from the four quarters of the earth.",
      "verse": "19:16",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 346.836,
      "end": 348.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and all the earth",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 348.549,
      "end": 351.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall see the salvation of the Lord, saith the prophet;",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 351.887,
      "end": 355.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every nation, kindred, tongue and people shall be blessed.",
      "verse": "19:17",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 355.864,
      "end": 359.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Nephi, have written these things unto my people,",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 359.295,
      "end": 361.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that perhaps I might persuade them",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 362.076,
      "end": 365.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would remember the Lord their Redeemer.",
      "verse": "19:18",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 365.867,
      "end": 368.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I speak unto all the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 369.066,
      "end": 372.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it so be that they should obtain these things.",
      "verse": "19:19",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 372.718,
      "end": 375.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, I have workings in the spirit,",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 375.545,
      "end": 377.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which doth weary me",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 377.35,
      "end": 379.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even that all my joints are weak,",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 380.177,
      "end": 382.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for those who are at Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 382.679,
      "end": 384.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for had not the Lord been merciful,",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 385.135,
      "end": 387.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to show unto me concerning them,",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 387.544,
      "end": 389.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as he had prophets of old,",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 389.814,
      "end": 391.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I should have perished also.",
      "verse": "19:20",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 392.398,
      "end": 397.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he surely did show unto the prophets of old all things concerning them;",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 397.361,
      "end": 400.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also he did show unto many concerning us;",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 400.792,
      "end": 404.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, it must needs be that we know concerning them",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 404.966,
      "end": 407.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they are written upon the plates of brass.",
      "verse": "19:21",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 408.479,
      "end": 413.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that I, Nephi, did teach my brethren these things;",
      "verse": "19:22",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 413.442,
      "end": 417.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it came to pass that I did read many things to them,",
      "verse": "19:22",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 417.244,
      "end": 419.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were engraven upon the plates of brass,",
      "verse": "19:22",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 420.164,
      "end": 426.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might know concerning the doings of the Lord in other lands, among people of old.",
      "verse": "19:22",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 426.788,
      "end": 429.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I did read many things unto them",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 429.197,
      "end": 431.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were written in the books of Moses;",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 431.653,
      "end": 434.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that I might more fully persuade them",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 434.666,
      "end": 436.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to believe in the Lord their Redeemer",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 437.168,
      "end": 438.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I did read unto them",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 438.881,
      "end": 441.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that which was written by the prophet Isaiah;",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 441.708,
      "end": 444.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I did liken all scriptures unto us,",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 444.674,
      "end": 447.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it might be for our profit and learning.",
      "verse": "19:23",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 448.373,
      "end": 450.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore I spake unto them, saying:",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 450.921,
      "end": 452.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Hear ye the words of the prophet,",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 453.144,
      "end": 456.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye who are a remnant of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 456.621,
      "end": 458.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a branch who have been broken off;",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 459.123,
      "end": 461.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hear ye the words of the prophet,",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 461.3,
      "end": 464.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were written unto all the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 464.22,
      "end": 466.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and liken them unto yourselves,",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 466.583,
      "end": 469.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may have hope as well as your brethren",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 469.828,
      "end": 472.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from whom ye have been broken off;",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 472.33,
      "end": 474.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for after this manner has the prophet written.",
      "verse": "19:24",
      "lineIndex": 147
    }
  ]
}